<title>POLAND: Tonsil revises down 1996 net.</title>
<headline>Tonsil revises down 1996 net.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tonsil SA preliminary results for financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						 1996	   1995</p>
<p>    operating				1.23   vs    5.21</p>
<p>    pre-tax				  0.52   vs    1.29</p>
<p>    net					0.22   vs    0.49</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Tonsil SA, earlier in its Q4 report it showed a 1996 net profit of 0.24 million. </p>
<p>    net sales			     66.76   vs   57.35</p>
<p>    costs of sales			53.41   vs   43.36</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.00   vs    0.55</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.30   vs    0.80</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   1.09   vs    1.00</p>
<p>    financial costs			1.82   vs    4.36</p>
<p>    investment			     1.32   vs    0.93</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
